        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Tamar\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Tamar:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Too bad they don't have a leg armor option for women.&nbsp; The fishnets make me think she's been raiding Black Canary's closet <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Like!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>and, btw, I've really been enjoying my jacket. Cosplayed yesterday morning. Had to explain to people that it was a cosplay, but after showing the card, people seem impressed.</p>",
